  "duel": {
    "_help": [
      "Soul Duels (scripts/SoulDuel.cs): turn-based pet fights in the Crimson Arena (Arenas.Start(\"souls\")). Pick up to 3 pets; face a generated Duelist of the Pit.",
      "Each turn both sides pick: a skill (pets.json skills: power, acc, cost = focus, priority, effect/chance/turns), swap, an item, or forfeit.",
      "Order: swaps and items first, then skill priority, then spd (chill halves spd). Damage = ((levelK x level + 2) x power x A / D / 50 + 2) x element x random(rollMin..1) x crit x buffs.",
      "  A = atk for physical skills, mag for elemental ones; D = def (elemental: average of def and mag). Pet hp is stats.hp x hpMul so duels last a few turns.",
      "Element wheel: \"wheel\" maps an element to the one it beats (x strong); the reverse is resisted (x weak); the same element (not physical) is resisted too. holy and shadow beat each other.",
      "Statuses (\"status\"): dot = share of max hp lost at turn end; skip = chance to lose the action; spdMul; dmgMul (damage dealt); takenMul (damage taken); noSwap.",
      "Focus: start, max, regen per turn. A pet with no affordable skill uses \"fallback\".",
      "Ladder (\"ranks\"): PlayerStats.DuelRank is the rank you fight next; a win moves you up one (the last rank repeats). size = trainer team size, lvl = levels over your team's average,",
      "  valor/petXp/gold rewards, cube = tier given with cubeChance, gearChance = pet gear roll, potions = items the trainer carries, smart 0..1 = how often the AI plays its best move.",
      "Trainer names: first + last names, title from the rank. pool: species the Duelists bring (also the Pet Trader's stock).",
      "Pet Trader (\"trader\", Odile by the arena; scripts/PetTrade.cs): swaps one pet for a random pool pet of the same rarity, level +-levelSpread, for fee = (feeBase + feePerLevel x level) x rarityFee.",
      "Trading between players (\"trade\"): at most maxPets pets a side, each pet's JSON at most maxPetJson characters, gold at most maxGold."
    ],
    "hpMul": 0.6, "dmgDiv": 50, "levelK": 0.4, "critChance": 0.06, "critMul": 1.5, "rollMin": 0.85, "strong": 1.5, "weak": 0.67,
    "strongText": "Searing!", "weakText": "Resisted...", "missText": "Missed",
    "focusStart": 2, "focusMax": 6, "focusRegen": 1, "fallback": "strike",
    "items": { "potion": { "name": "Soul Draught", "count": 2, "heal": 0.5 }, "revive": { "name": "Ember of Return", "count": 1, "heal": 0.5 } },
    "wheel": { "fire": "poison", "poison": "lightning", "lightning": "frost", "frost": "fire", "holy": "shadow", "shadow": "holy" },
